    kind: work_item  # 5b9d
    title: "ruby emits a constant receiver's module slot lowercased and without its namespace (Net::HTTP.get -> ruby:http:0-0:get), so an I/O overlay row spelled as ruby writes it cannot match"  # 5b9d
    status: todo_hard  # 5b9d
    priority: 2  # 5b9d
    parent:  # 5b9d
    tags:  # 5b9d
    - ruby  # 5b9d
